史慈於勇裡。七縣平定，拜征虜中郎將，征江夏，還平鄱陽。策薨，奔喪於吳。後權復征江夏，範與張昭留守。曹公至赤壁，與周瑜等俱拒破之，拜裨將軍，領彭澤太守，以彭澤、柴桑、歷陽為奉邑。劉備詣京見權，範密請留備。後遷平南將軍，屯柴桑。","person_mention_id":"c-sanguozhi-056-lvfan:line047:m0006"}],"attestations":[{"id":"t-wu056-t-wu056-lvfan5:a","paragraph_id":"c-sanguozhi-056-lvfan:line047","person_mention_id":"c-sanguozhi-056-lvfan:line047:m0006","start":10,"end":14,"surface":"吳都太守","usage":"narrative","date_expression":null}],"human_reviewed":false,"reviewer":"Codex（AI 代理）","model":null},{"id":"t-wu056-t-wu056-lvfan11","person_id":"b88_fje_bm1","kind":"office","title":"揚州牧","mode":"attestation","status":"source_attested","effective_period":{"start":{"status":"unknown","date_expression":null,"evidence":[]},"end":{"status":"unknown","date_expression":null,"evidence":[]}},"interpretation_note":"本句所載職官，任免時間未詳。","evidence":[{"work_id":"w-sanguozhi","book_id":"b-sanguozhi-056","chapter_id":"c-sanguozhi-056-lvfan","source_id":"s-sanguozhi-056-lvfan","paragraph_id":"c-sanguozhi-056-lvfan:line047-pei01-01","quote":"《九州春秋》曰：初平三年，揚州刺史陳禕死，袁術使瑀領揚州牧。後術為曹公所敗於封丘，南人叛瑀，瑀拒之。術走陰陵，好辭以下瑀，瑀不知權，而又怯，不即攻術。術於淮北集兵向壽春。瑀懼，使其弟公琰請和於術。術執之而進，瑀走歸下邳。","person_mention_id":"c-sanguozhi-056-lvfan:line047-pei01-01:m0024"}],"attestations":[{"id":"t-wu056-t-wu056-lvfan11:a","paragraph_id":"c-sanguozhi-056-lvfan:line047-pei01-01","person_mention_id":"c-sanguozhi-056-lvfan:line047-pei01-01:m0024","start":26,"end":29,"surface":"揚州牧","usage":"narrative","date_expression":null}],"human_reviewed":false,"reviewer":"Codex（AI 代理）","model":null}],"address_assertions":[],"table_occurrences":[],"date_normalizations":[],"birth_order_constraints":[],"preferred_birth_order_constraints":[],"identity_decisions":[],"equivalence_decisions":[],"passages":[{"id":"c-sanguozhi-056-lvfan:line047","text":"　　是時下邳陳瑀自號吳都太守，住海西，與強族嚴白虎交通。策自將討虎，別遣範與徐逸攻瑀於海西，梟其大將陳牧。又從攻祖郎於陵陽，太史慈於勇裡。七縣平定，拜征虜中郎將，征江夏，還平鄱陽。策薨，奔喪於吳。後權復征江夏，範與張昭留守。曹公至赤壁，與周瑜等俱拒破之，拜裨將軍，領彭澤太守，以彭澤、柴桑、歷陽為奉邑。劉備詣京見權，範密請留備。後遷平南將軍，屯柴桑。","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-sanguozhi-056-lvfan: